Done when: your summary says what you did and what is open
Then: a human accepts the result
Finish with finish_step: done, back (to draft), or blocked (your question)."
`;

exports[`the phase contract of a step > in knowledge: draft shows goal, done-when and then 1`] = `
"## Step: draft (2 of 4)
Goal: Do: write the result of the ticket from the research, as a note. Do not research again: gaps that matter go back. Deliver: the note, linked to the ticket, and every task ticked that it fulfils. Stop: finish_step with done. If the research lacks something the draft needs, finish_step with back and name it in the summary.
Done when: all tasks are ticked; a note is linked to the ticket (notes_create, then link_note_to_ticket)
Then: a fresh agent works the next step, critique
Finish with finish_step: done, back (to research), or blocked (your question)."
`;

exports[`the phase contract of a step > in knowledge: research shows goal, done-when and then 1`] = `
"## Step: research (1 of 4)
Goal: Do: gather what the ticket asks about; search and read the notes first and keep to what the sources say. Do not write the final text yet. Deliver: your findings with their sources as the summary, and one task per criterion the draft must meet. Stop: finish_step with done. If a question stays open that you cannot answer, finish_step with blocked and ask it.
Done when: the ticket has at least one task, one per acceptance criterion
Then: a fresh agent works the next step, draft
Finish with finish_step: done, or blocked (your question)."
`;

