exports[`the phase contract of a step > in software: plan shows goal, done-when and then 1`] = `
"## Step: plan (2 of 5)
Goal: Do: plan the work; do not refine the ticket and do not implement it. Check that no blocker is still open; if one is, finish_step with blocked and name it. Read the linked notes. Deliver: the plan as your summary, in a few lines: the steps in order, what each touches and the risks. Stop: finish_step with done. Only if the description no longer matches reality, finish_step with back and say why in the summary.
Done when: your summary says what you did and what is open
Then: a fresh agent works the next step, implement
Finish with finish_step: done, back (to refine), or blocked (your question)."
`;

exports[`the phase contract of a step > in software: refine shows goal, done-when and then 1`] = `
"## Step: refine (1 of 5)
Goal: Do: propose the scope yourself from what the ticket says: what is in and out, a size and observable acceptance criteria. Fill gaps with sensible defaults and name them as assumptions. Ask the human only for a genuine product decision you cannot default, never as your first step. Deliver: an updated description, one task per acceptance criterion and the size. Stop: finish_step with done, naming your assumptions in the summary.
Done when: the ticket has at least one task, one per acceptance criterion; the ticket has a size (XS, S, M, L or XL); the description is not empty
Then: a fresh agent works the next step, plan
Finish with finish_step: done, or blocked (your question)."
`;
